              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 11:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngwani musongo? Ngonguwe uuti kaswiilile aya makani. Ngwani uucenjede? Ngonguwe uuti kaazibisye, Nkaambo inzila zya-Jehova zililuleme, abantu baluleme mbibati ende kabotu mulinzizyo, anukuti basizibi bayoolebwa mulinzizyo.",
          "type": "text",
